  <ferc:DisclosureOfInterimDisclosureTextBlock id="HHBD3FB81A19097E05744DB228EFAAF64C" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfInterimDisclosureTextBlock>
  <ferc:GeneralDescriptionOfConstructionOverheadTextBlock id="HHD83F070B97EA6422D24ABE6610ADFB02" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;O&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16.4267px;"&gt;verhead is charged to capital projects based on costs allocable to total capital expenditures or based on direct labor charges. Overhead pools allocated based on total capital expenditures utilize cost pools determined through department time estimates divided by estimated capital expenditures. Overhead pools charged based on direct labor costs utilize costs pools based on estimated benefits and a component of office and technology costs divided by estimated labor costs. If required, overhead rates are adjusted periodically during the year to reflect the ratio of actual overhead costs in production to actual capital expenditures or actual labor costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 14.9333px;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:GeneralDescriptionOfConstructionOverheadTextBlock>
