&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;1 Primary AFUDC equity gross up, Cost of Service Deferral, and Levelized Deprecation, and Other Regulatory Liabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;2 Primary Deferred Income Tax Adjustment, Deferred Income Tax Adjustment Gross-up, and Operational Flow Order Liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;strong&gt;NATURAL GAS IMBALANCES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.5pt; line-height: 10.8pt; margin: 0in 53.8pt 0in .5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;The Comparative Balance Sheet includes in-kind balances&amp;#160;as a result of&amp;#160;differences in gas volumes received and delivered&amp;#160;for&amp;#160;customers. Since settlement of certain imbalances is in-kind, changes in their balances do not&amp;#160;have an effect on&amp;#160;our Statements of Cash Flows. Miscellaneous Current and Accrued Assets include $3.7 million as of December 31,&amp;#160;2025,&amp;#160;and $2.4 million as of December 31,&amp;#160;2024&amp;#160;respectively, and Miscellaneous Current and Accrued Liabilities include $5.3 million as of December 31, 2025 and $2.2 million as of December 31, 2024 respectively, related to all gas imbalances. Natural gas volumes owed to or by us are valued at natural gas market index prices as of the balance sheet dates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
