&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.5pt; line-height: 10.6pt; margin: 0in 49.25pt .1pt 224.3pt;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;The measurement of weighted average depreciation rate excludes non-depreciable assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 10.6pt; margin: 12.0pt 0in .2pt 0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Utility plant accruals were $85.3&amp;#160;million and $40.9&amp;#160;million&amp;#160;at&amp;#160;December 31, 2025&amp;#160;and 2024, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Amortization expense of intangible assets&amp;#160;was&amp;#160;$nil for both 2025&amp;#160;and 2024, respectively. Estimated amortization expense for 2026&amp;#160;through 2030&amp;#160;is insignificant per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Gross additions to Utility Plant (less nuclear fuel) on the Statement of Cash Flows excludes $74.1 million and $63.3 million as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively, of significant non-cash transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;The total amount of AFUDC included in the Statement of Income was $34.6&amp;#160;million in 2025&amp;#160;(an equity component of $22.8&amp;#160;million and interest expense component of $11.8&amp;#160;million) and $26.5&amp;#160;million in 2024&amp;#160;(an equity component of $24.3&amp;#160;million and interest expense component of $2.2&amp;#160;million).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;The composite weighted-average depreciation rates were 2.14% for 2025&amp;#160;and 2.18% for 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;7. Debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" style="margin-left: 13pt; border-image: initial; border: medium none currentcolor;" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 166.15pt; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; border-left: solid black 1.0pt; border-bottom: none; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.05pt;" valign="top" width="222"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 55.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;" valign="top" width="74"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;"&gt;Maturity&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
