      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Loss and Unaccounted For (LAUF). LAUF incurred in the Operation of the pipeline is tracked and flowed through to customers. LAUF amounts are recorded as a debit to account 813-Other Gas Supply Expense and a credit to account 812-Gas Used for Other Operations.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
