    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH158B39212B6BB880953A179D5305E0CD" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Effective November 1, 2025 (Docket No. RP25-844), Gateway Project (FT-AGW), Kingsport Expansion Project (FT-AKPT), Loudon Expansion Project (FT-ALE), and Wacker Project (FT-AWAC) have been rolled in to system recourse rates (FT-A).</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
