      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>The valuation of the net excesses or deficiencies which result from shipper supplied gas, as well as the valuation of the dispositions of excesses and the sources of deficiencies are reflected in the annual cashout report and refund plan filed pursuant to our tariff.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
